<title>FRANCE: Comptoirs Modernes 9-mth sales rise.</title>
<headline>Comptoirs Modernes 9-mth sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover				    22,202, up 11.4 percent</p>
<p>NOTE - Retailer Comptoir Modernes gave its sales figures in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
